#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-installation.rst:53
msgid "Mission Planner Advanced Installation"
msgstr "Mission Planner 高级安装"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-installation.rst:5
#: 6cb6a6451354442abd57f1d742e61765
msgid "Installing Mission Planner"
msgstr "安装 Mission Planner"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-installation.rst:7
#: bbcbef3800554835a37755be28f0ebfa
msgid ""
"Mission Planner was designed for native Windows installation. However, it is"
" possible to use it under Linux (with some occasional issues) and there is a"
" Beta version for Android OS."
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner 专为 Windows 原生安装而设计，但也可在 Linux 上运行（偶有问题），并提供适用于 Android 系统的 "
"Beta 版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-installation.rst:10
#: 402ce0731a5441ab883dddc3a7a34213
msgid "Windows Installation"
msgstr "Windows 安装"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-installation.rst:12
#: 011a1e512d064672b25f6417a728052b
msgid ""
"The following instructions show how to install *Mission Planner* on Windows."
" These instructions will be suitable for most users.  For advanced users and"
" non-standard installations, instructions are found :ref:`here: <mission-"
"planner-advanced-installation>`.  A useful video guide for advanced "
"installation of *Mission Planner* is located `here "
"<https://youtu.be/cw7adeD1yeg>`__."
msgstr ""
"以下说明介绍如何在 Windows 上安装 *Mission Planner*，适用于大多数用户。高级用户和非标准安装的说明请参见 "
":ref:`此处：<mission-planner-advanced-installation>`。*Mission Planner* "
"高级安装的实用视频教程位于 `此处 <https://youtu.be/cw7adeD1yeg>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-installation.rst:14
#: 246653f7601d49babdc728e19558e662
msgid ""
"Download the `latest Mission Planner installer from here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/MissionPlanner/MissionPlanner-"
"latest.msi>`__"
msgstr ""
"从 `此处下载最新的 Mission Planner 安装程序 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/MissionPlanner/MissionPlanner-"
"latest.msi>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-installation.rst:15
#: 7fae7c7d0211424a962859930193e1cc
msgid "Double click on the downloaded **.msi** file to run the installer"
msgstr "双击下载的 **.msi** 文件运行安装程序"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-installation.rst:20
#: 8750815f1e0f46f58f4e25274fe3e838
msgid ""
"Follow the instructions to complete the setup process. The installation "
"utility will automatically install any necessary software drivers. If you "
"receive a DirectX installation error, please update your DirectX plug-in "
"from the `Windows Download Center <https://www.microsoft.com/en-"
"us/download/windows.aspx>`__."
msgstr ""
"按照提示完成安装过程，安装程序将自动安装所需的软件驱动。若出现 DirectX 安装错误，请从 `Windows 下载中心 "
"<https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/download/windows.aspx>`__ 更新 DirectX 插件。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-installation.rst:25
#: da3ed641052e46a2bc8f4522f3197426
msgid ""
"If you receive the warning pictured below, select **Install this driver "
"software anyway** to continue."
msgstr "若出现如下警告，请选择 **仍然安装此驱动程序软件** 以继续。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-installation.rst:30
#: 368298e00b5b4a34b23ca2305c9d9884
msgid ""
"Mission Planner is normally installed in the **C:\\\\Program Files "
"(x86)\\\\Mission Planner** folder."
msgstr "Mission Planner 通常安装在 **C:\\\\Program Files (x86)\\\\Mission Planner** 文件夹中。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-installation.rst:32
#: 4d09920261f149c9abe9a8cd9b0198e3
msgid ""
"An icon to open the *Mission Planner* is created according to your "
"instructions during the installation."
msgstr "安装时，将根据您的设置创建打开 *Mission Planner* 的图标。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-installation.rst:35
#: 84d651c5ad3b4a919a11751ce59c03c3
msgid "Open Mission Planner"
msgstr "打开 Mission Planner"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-installation.rst:37
#: 20d115aed884413db4fd72b944658978
msgid ""
"Once installation is complete, open *Mission Planner* by clicking on its "
"system icon."
msgstr "安装完成后，点击系统图标打开 *Mission Planner*。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-installation.rst:39
#: 336332bee1de49d3bf9e9828e69af70f
msgid "Then you can either:"
msgstr "然后您可以选择："

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-installation.rst:41
#: 07b235f001264eb2831ac09c2805a53e
msgid ""
":ref:`Connect Mission Planner to AutoPilot <common-connect-mission-planner-"
"autopilot>` in order to receive telemetry and control the vehicle OR"
msgstr ""
":ref:`将 Mission Planner 连接到飞控 <common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot>` "
"以接收数传并控制飞行器，或"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-installation.rst:42
#: 79f80b1dfa9d4c0ea6971e59f8cf4f0e
msgid ""
":ref:`Load Firmware <common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk>` OR :ref:`plan "
"autonomous missions <common-mission-planning>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`加载固件 <common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk>` 或 :ref:`规划自主任务 <common-"
"mission-planning>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-installation.rst:44
#: 804bfe9962b944409ce2dfe72a8e906d
msgid ""
"If ArduPilot firmware is not already installed on the autopilot, see "
":ref:`Loading Firmware to boards without existing ArduPilot firmware "
"<common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards>`."
msgstr ""
"若飞控尚未安装 ArduPilot 固件，请参见 :ref:`为无 ArduPilot 固件的飞控加载固件 <common-loading-"
"firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-installation.rst:47
#: 98ac46dbf62a4b4ca0c40c13b39a49ca
msgid "Updating Mission Planner"
msgstr "更新 Mission Planner"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-installation.rst:49
#: e8e0bdca10674c22a46c66b35200bf89
msgid ""
"*Mission Planner* automatically notifies you about available updates (when "
"it is connected to the Internet)."
msgstr "*Mission Planner* 在连接互联网时会自动通知您可用的更新。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-installation.rst:51
#: 4a0ec7db5444409daf1d35040457e6c3
msgid "Please always run the most current version of Mission Planner."
msgstr "请始终运行最新版本的 Mission Planner。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-installation.rst:59
#: f95a440f78494d74a8da17f1e37666cf
msgid "Mission Planner on Android"
msgstr "Android 版 Mission Planner"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-installation.rst:61
#: e601f5e03dd0467c9b9fe48eefc25e1e
msgid ""
"A version for Android is in development and can be downloaded from the "
"`Google Play Store here "
"<https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.michaeloborne.MissionPlanner>`__."
msgstr ""
"Android 版本正在开发中，可从 `Google Play 商店此处 "
"<https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.michaeloborne.MissionPlanner>`__"
" 下载。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-installation.rst:63
#: 07fcbcdd3a414580b14e0a0baae917eb
msgid ""
"The latest version is also available `here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/MissionPlanner/releases/tag/latest>`__. "
"Download to device, and double click on it to install."
msgstr ""
"最新版本也可在 `此处 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/MissionPlanner/releases/tag/latest>`__ "
"获取。下载到设备后，双击安装。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-installation.rst:66
#: 8550aa4e9bdd4c97a11f3e71919d1c2d
msgid "Mission Planner on Linux"
msgstr "Linux 版 Mission Planner"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-installation.rst:68
#: d95677eaaeca42b08daf44dda1a4741f
msgid ""
"It is possible to run most Windows based programs on many Linux "
"Distributions using MONO. Mission Planner does run under MONO but will have "
"occasional issues and/or crashes. QGC and MAVProxy are alternatives that run"
" stably in Linux, but if Mission Planner is really desired, you can follow "
"these steps:"
msgstr ""
"可以使用 MONO 在多种 Linux 发行版上运行大多数 Windows 程序。Mission Planner 可在 MONO "
"下运行，但偶有问题或崩溃。QGroundControl 和 MAVProxy 是在 Linux 上稳定运行的替代方案，如果确实需要 Mission "
"Planner，可按以下步骤操作："

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-installation.rst:71
#: 2a714d3f03f74e77a7a42dbc5a5daf2f
msgid ""
"Download and install the latest version of MONO from `here "
"<https://www.mono-project.com/download/stable/>`__"
msgstr ""
"从 `此处 <https://www.mono-project.com/download/stable/>`__ 下载并安装最新版 MONO"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-installation.rst:72
#: 352ab8bb98994e69bf5a833bc872d03e
msgid ""
"Download Mission Planner as a zip file from `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/MissionPlanner/MissionPlanner-"
"latest.zip>`__ and  unzip to a directory."
msgstr ""
"从 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/MissionPlanner/MissionPlanner-"
"latest.zip>`__ 将 Mission Planner 下载为 zip 文件，并解压到某个目录。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-installation.rst:73
#: f86063bdff9e4f4f910413f4967ef7a0
msgid "Change to that directory and execute:"
msgstr "切换到该目录并执行："
